<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f4f4; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
    .header { background: #1a73e8; color: #fff; padding: 24px 32px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; }
    .body { padding: 24px 32px; }
    .status-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; }
    .badge-OUVERTE  { background: #e8f0fe; color: #1a73e8; }
    .badge-EN_COURS { background: #fff3e0; color: #e65100; }
    .badge-RESOLUE  { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
    .badge-REJETEE  { background: #fce4ec; color: #c62828; }
    .arrow { font-size: 20px; color: #888; }
    .comment { margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f5f5f5; border-left: 4px solid #1a73e8; border-radius: 4px; }
    .field { margin: 6px 0; }
    .field strong { display: inline-block; width: 130px; color: #555; }
    .footer { padding: 16px 32px; background: #f8f8f8; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Réclamation #{{number}} — Mise à jour du statut</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Bonjour {{recipientName}},</p>
      <p>Le statut de votre réclamation a été mis à jour par <strong>{{authorName}}</strong>.</p>

      <div class="status-row">
        <span class="badge badge-{{fromStatus}}">{{fromStatus}}</span>
        <span class="arrow">→</span>
        <span class="badge badge-{{toStatus}}">{{toStatus}}</span>
      </div>

      <div class="field"><strong>Bâtiment :</strong> {{building}}</div>
      <div class="field"><strong>Salle :</strong> {{room}}</div>
      <div class="field"><strong>Catégorie :</strong> {{category}}</div>

      {{#if comment}}
      <div class="comment">
        <strong>Commentaire :</strong><br />
        {{comment}}
      </div>
      {{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Ceci est un message automatique — ne pas répondre directement.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
